  "AA Intelligence Index v5.0.1": "Replaced v4.3.2 around 2026-11-10. 9 evals, 4 categories at 25% each: Knowledge Work (AA-Briefcase 15, AutomationBench-AA 5, GDP.pdf 5), Coding (FrontierCode-AA 2.0 15, Terminal-Bench 4.0 10), Science (Terminal-Bench-Science 15, CritPt v2 Hard 10), General (AA-Omniscience v1.1 15, HLE-Diamond 10). Dropped: HLE, CritPt v1, SciCode, AA-LCR, GDPval-AA (still run standalone; no per-task cost any more). All models' index scores and costs re-backfilled.",
