  "new charts": "HLE-Diamond and CritPt v2 replace HLE and CritPt (Carbon has neither old score). FrontierCode-AA 2.0 added. Terminal-Bench Science now per level for all models: line chart instead of bars. MKA (AA's run of Google DeepMind's Multimodal Knowledge Agent benchmark) added as bars: top level only.",
