  "not available": "FrontierCode 1.1 (Cognition) and DeepSWE leaderboard (last generated 2026-06-20): neither new model. SWE-Bench Pro: not reported by Anthropic or Google. AA-AnalystAgent: no Fable 5.2 or Carbon. Harvey LAB-AA: no Carbon. Terminal-Bench 2.1: only GPT-6 Astra once Fable 5.1 left, chart dropped. SciCode: AA did not run Carbon.",
